 on the establishment, workforce, industry and applicable law."}]},{"heading":"Workplace Harassment Compliance","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A labour/employment consultant should understand workplace-harassment prevention requirements, particularly the legal framework governing prevention of sexual harassment at the workplace."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Prevention policies"},{"text":"Internal Committee requirements where applicable"},{"text":"Complaint procedures"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Inquiry processes"},{"text":"Employer responsibilities"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Awareness training"},{"text":"A consultant should maintain neutrality and procedural fairness when advising on workplace complaints."}]}]},{"heading":"Employee Disciplinary Process","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the general principles behind disciplinary action."},{"type":"flow","items":["Alleged Misconduct","Preliminary Fact Assessment","Notice / Charge","Employee Response","Inquiry Where Required","Evidence / Witnesses","Findings","Decision by Competent Authority","Appropriate Action","Documentation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact procedures depend on applicable law, employment terms, standing orders/policies and organizational context."}]},{"heading":"Labour Compliance Audit","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A student should learn how to conduct a basic compliance review."},{"type":"h","text":"Audit Process"},{"type":"flow","items":["Define Scope","Collect Documents","Map Applicable Laws","Review HR Records","Identify Gaps","Classify Risk","Recommend Corrective Actions","Implementation","Re-Audit"]},{"type":"h","text":"Documents to Review"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employment contracts"},{"text":"Wage records"},{"text":"Attendance records"},{"text":"Leave records"},{"text":"Employee registers"},{"text":"HR policies"},{"text":"Statutory filings"},{"text":"Benefit records"},{"text":"Workplace-safety documentation"},{"text":"Disciplinary records"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Strategy","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Practical HR and legal exposure is highly valuable."},{"type":"h","text":"Target Organizations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Law firms"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"HR departments"},{"text":"Labour-law consultancies"},{"text":"HR consulting firms"},{"text":"Industrial organizations"},{"text":"Manufacturing companies"},{"text":"IT companies"},{"text":"Government labour departments"},{"text":"Trade-union/legal-aid organizations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship Roles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Labour Law Intern"},{"text":"Employment Law Intern"},{"text":"HR Legal Intern"},{"text":"Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Legal Research Intern"},{"text":"Employee Relations Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal Progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["Labour Law Internship","Employment Contract Review","HR Compliance Exposure","Employee Relations","Labour Compliance Executive","Labour Law Consultant"]}]},{"heading":"Projects During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Employment Contract Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical employment agreement and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Probation"},{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"IP"},{"text":"Termination"},{"text":"Notice"},{"text":"Dispute resolution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Labour Compliance Checklist"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a compliance framework for a hypothetical company."},{"type":"flow","items":["Company Profile","Workforce Classification","Applicable Laws","Compliance Requirements","Documents / Registers","Responsible Department","Due Date","Evidence","Compliance Status"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Employee Grievance Case Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a hypothetical dispute involving:"},{"type":"list",